    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Have you ever walked "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "barefoot",
            "zh": "赤脚"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on hot "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "sand",
            "ref": "v-sand"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "? Then you know how hot it can get. The Sahara "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "撒哈拉沙漠"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is really hot. Sand "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "temperatures",
            "ref": "v-temperature"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " there can get as high as 60℃. In the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "desert",
            "ref": "v-desert"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " lives the world’s fastest ant. It is the Saharan silver ant "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "撒哈拉银蚁"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The ant can move 0.855 "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "metres",
            "ref": "v-metre"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " per second. That’s 108 times its body "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "length",
            "ref": "v-length"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". How fast is that? "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Imagine",
            "zh": "想象"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a 1.8 m-tall man running 195 metres per second!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The ant has six legs. When it’s “running”, it uses three legs at a time. They are the front and back legs on one side, and the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "middle",
            "ref": "v-middle"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " leg on the other. When it goes faster, all six of its legs move off the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "ground",
            "ref": "v-ground"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " together."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "So why does the ant go so fast? The sun is really hot in the Sahara. The ant needs to find food quickly. Or it may get "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "roasted",
            "zh": "烤"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "! And it won’t "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "sink",
            "ref": "v-sink"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " into the soft sand when moving quickly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      }
    ]
  },
